    <verse name="c1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="F#m"/>Leave your <chord name="G"/>sheep and leave <chord name="A7/G"/>your lamb,<br/>
      <chord name="D/F#"/>Rise Up, <chord name="F#m"/>shepherd, <chord name="A7"/>and follow.<br/>
      <chord name="Cdim"/>Leave your ewes <chord name="Em/G"/>and <chord name="G"/>leave <chord name="Em"/>your rams,<br/>
      <chord name="D/F#"/>Rise Up, shepherd, <chord name="F#m"/>and follow. Follow, Follow,<br/>
